5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I’m really excited to dig into these proposals. I just worry about relying on things outside our control, like weather or suppliers.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the optimism, Yumi. I’m more concerned we’re ignoring the data from similar past attempts. We shouldn’t reinvent the wheel blindly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I’m watching how you all frame this. We keep adding tasks without checking if the staff actually have the skills to handle them.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I focus on how funding is structured. A budget that looks fine at the vote often collapses by year two.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m a bit nervous, but I think we should check how our building locations and opening times affect who can actually reach us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, that’s a great point! I’d love to see those past records. @Shion, do you have specific skill gaps in mind?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, I’ll pull the records. @Shion, I suspect the gap is supervision, not just technical skill.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, supervision is just one layer. I need to verify if the roster actually holds the technical certifications required for these new roles.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I agree. I need to see the grant terms and endowment rules to understand the long-term financial shape.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, that makes sense. I’m still worried about access, though. Do you think the funding structure affects where we can physically place services?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that’s a really important question! I’m hoping the data will show us if we can keep services stable even when conditions get tricky.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Daisuke, placement is a physical constraint, but funding dictates what we can sustain there. I’ll check the grant terms to see if that flexibility exists.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, checking the grant terms is fine, but it misses the operational reality. I need to verify the actual skill sets on the roster before we commit to anything.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, valid point. I’ll check the county grant terms and the endowment to see how the funding is actually shaped over time.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, I think so. If the money runs out, we can’t keep the doors open for people who can’t travel.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Minako, I’m choosing to look into the winter road closures and the supplier delivery windows. I need to know how much our schedule depends on things we can’t control!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll examine the two programmes begun six years ago and the volunteer register. I need to see what actually survived and who is qualified to run it.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,I’ll check the volunteer register and the tool certification records. I need to know exactly who is qualified to supervise these new commitments.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,I’ll look into the county grant terms and the endowment. I need to see how the funding is actually shaped over time.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the bus links in the outer wards and the evening room bookings. I need to see who is actually cut off from us.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
